          "7": { "$value": "{color.chart.violet.on-light}" },
          "8": { "$value": "{color.chart.green.on-light}" },
          "$description": "Categorical, in fixed order — assign slot 1, 2, 3… and never cycle. Slot 1 is the brand ink (deliberately outside the 0.43–0.77 lightness band: it is the \"main\" series). Past 8 series, fold into viz.other."
        },
        "other": {
          "$value": "{color.dark-blue.300}",
          "$description": "\"Other\", \"the rest\" and de-emphasised series. Replaces GREY #A6ADBF."
