          "5": { "$value": "{color.mid-pink}" },
          "6": { "$value": "{color.pink.600}" },
          "7": { "$value": "{color.pink.900}" },
          "$description": "Diverging: 1–3 navy-blue arm, 4 the neutral midpoint, 5–7 pink arm. The cool arm ends in mid blue rather than pale lavender: pale lavender and light pink look the same with protanopia (ΔE00 1.6), mid blue and mid pink do not (18.6). Every step stays ≥13.5 ΔE00 from its opposite number under all three simulations."
        }
      }
